{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2022-07-28 10:00:00', 'title': 'CHILDREN OF RAILROADERS BENEFIT FROM NEW $1.2 MILLION SCHOLARSHIP FUND', 'text': "NORFOLK SOUTHERN LAUNCHES ANNUAL PROGRAM SUPPORTING COLLEGE STUDENTS ATLANTA , JULY 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ONE HUNDRED CHILDREN OF NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) EMPLOYEES WILL RECEIVE COLLEGE SCHOLARSHIPS OF UP TO $10,000 OVER FOUR YEARS THROUGH THE COMPANY'S NEW THOROUGHBRED SCHOLARS PROGRAM.\xa0IN ADDITION, THREE STUDENTS WILL RECEIVE SPECIAL AWARDS OF UP TO $40,000 OVER FOUR YEARS."}